:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Karin Nekozuka (Enemy)]].''
'''Karin Nekozuka''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] who was implemented in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and is exclusive to the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. It is acquired as a drop after beating any of the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Karin|Date Chance: Karin]] stages.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 389
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Karin Nekozuka
|name2 = Karin Nekozuka CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Karin Nekozuka CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Reminiscent of [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]], Karin Nekozuka has higher speed and range in exchange for a higher cooldown and a longer attack frequency. While Karin can substitute for Shaman early on, she isn't as effective as him, as Shaman can be stacked faster and attacks faster while being able to target the same enemies. Getting Necro-Dancer Cat is merely the final nail in the coffin. The one unique way you could possibly use Karin is to rush into a long-ranged Floating enemy and freeze it, though this requires a higher proc chance than what Karin has and is awfully niche.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

